===Noun===
'''ferricyanide'''
#{{chemistry}} any of various [[salt]]s containing the [[trivalent]] [[anion]] Fe(CN)<sub>6</sub><sup>3-</sup>; used in making [[blue]] [[pigment]]s
#{{chemistry}} a [[complex ion]] in which a central [[ferric]] [[iron]] atom is surrounded by six [[cyanide]] [[ion]]s

